# Security And No-Claim Proof

Native app WP10 inherits shared app/game WP11 negative tests:

- observe-only cannot execute hard-control adapters;
- manual-required and not-claimed cannot execute;
- Android hide/suspend require Device Owner or Profile Owner proof;
- iOS shield requires FamilyControls and ManagedSettings proof;
- macOS hard block requires MDM, Endpoint Security, or System Extension proof;
- Linux hard block requires mechanism, distro, and session proof.

No private app paths, command lines, screenshots, child content, or OS secrets
were introduced.
